// The navigated crowd (115, ADR-2220/2223/2225): ORCA, the scene block, and the Crowd Lab's
// environments e01-e03 and e08 with their metric assertions.
//
// Every lab case loads the committed environment from examples/labs/crowd/ (generated by build.py,
// checked byte for byte below) and steps the composition's own crowd -- the object a play, a seek
// and a render all drive -- so what is asserted here is what is drawn.
